markers.override.remove.desc = Remove the override of a map marker
markers.override.remove.success = Removed the override of marker {marker}
markers.override.remove.none = Marker {marker} has no override
markers.override.clear.desc = Remove every map marker override of this world
markers.override.clear.success = Cleared all map marker overrides
